# PM11: Seq tail bound to Variable should not be forced.
# The tail contains a raise — if the tail were forced eagerly, this would error.
# Instead, the tail stays as a lazy thunk and the match body never touches it.
[match [seq 1 [raise "tail must not be forced"]]
    [Seq h t]:  h
    _:          0]
=== out
Int(1)
